{"name":"Toast","hex":"#9f715f","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"toast","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Bread that has been toasted (cooked lightly by browning).","A proposed salutation (e.g. saying \"cheers\") while drinking alcohol."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To cook lightly by browning by means of direct exposure to a fire or other heat source.","To cook lightly by browning under a grill or in a toaster; to grill."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/toast"}],"entries":[{"title":"Toast (food)","blocks":[{"text":"Toast is sliced bread that has been browned by radiant heat. The browning is the result of a Maillard reaction altering the flavor of the bread and making it crispier in texture. The firm surface is easier to spread toppings on and the warmth can help spreads such as butter reach their melting point. Toasting is a common method of making stale bread more palatable. Bread is commonly toasted using devices specifically designed for such, e.g., a toaster or a toaster oven. Toast may contain more acrylamide, caused by the browning process, which is suspected to be a carcinogen. However, claims that acrylamide in burnt food causes cancer have not been proven."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Toast-3.jpg/330px-Toast-3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toast_(food)"},{"title":"Toast (honor)","blocks":[{"text":"A toast is a ritual during which a drink is taken as an expression of honour or goodwill. The term may be applied to the person, animal or object so honoured, the drink taken, or the verbal expression accompanying the drink. Thus, a person could be \"the toast of the evening\", for whom someone \"proposes a toast\" to congratulate and for whom a third person \"toasts\" in agreement. The ritual forms the basis of the literary and performance genre, of which Mark Twain's \"To the Babies\" is a well-known example."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Barack_Obama_and_Julia_Gillard_toast_Nov_16_2011_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Barack_Obama_and_Julia_Gillard_toast_Nov_16_2011_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toast_(honor)"},{"title":"Toast (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Toast is a 2010 British biographical comedy-drama film based on the autobiographical novel of the same name by the cookery writer Nigel Slater. The film was directed by S. J. Clarkson and written by Lee Hall. The cast includes Freddie Highmore, Helena Bonham Carter, Ken Stott and Oscar Kennedy. It received a gala at the 2011 Berlin International Film Festival. As a television film it was first broadcast on BBC One on 30 December 2010 and was given a theatrical release in cinemas on 11 August 2011."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c4/Toast_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toast_(film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Toaster.jpg/500px-Toaster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Toaster.jpg/1280px-Toaster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Toaster.jpg/500px-Toaster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A classic two-slot toaster","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AToaster.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Vegemite_and_jelly.jpg/500px-Vegemite_and_jelly.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Vegemite_and_jelly.jpg/1280px-Vegemite_and_jelly.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Vegemite_and_jelly.jpg/500px-Vegemite_and_jelly.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Left: Toast with butter and Vegemite. Right: With butter and strawberry jam.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AVegemite_and_jelly.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Toasts_photographed_in_West_Bengal%2C_India.jpg/500px-Toasts_photographed_in_West_Bengal%2C_India.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Toasts_photographed_in_West_Bengal%2C_India.jpg/1280px-Toasts_photographed_in_West_Bengal%2C_India.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Toasts_photographed_in_West_Bengal%2C_India.jpg/500px-Toasts_photographed_in_West_Bengal%2C_India.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Toasted bread slices in West Bengal, India, used during teatime","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AToasts_photographed_in_West_Bengal%2C_India.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Pizza_toast%2C_at_Gusto.jpg/500px-Pizza_toast%2C_at_Gusto.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Pizza_toast%2C_at_Gusto.jpg/1280px-Pizza_toast%2C_at_Gusto.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Pizza_toast%2C_at_Gusto.jpg/500px-Pizza_toast%2C_at_Gusto.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Pizza toast","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APizza_toast%2C_at_Gusto.